6. Practical Considerations for AI Software Architects
Assess user needs: Does your app require real-time, offline AI? Favor frontend.
Evaluate model size and complexity: Large NLP or vision models usually backend.
Plan for data privacy and compliance: Sensitive data may mandate frontend AI.
Design for scalability: Backend AI scales with cloud infrastructure.
Consider update strategy: Backend AI allows seamless updates.
Optimize user experience: Hybrid solutions often provide best UX.
